<BaseLayout title="About — Haidar System">
<section class="wrap page"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>A personal system for turning real problems into useful action.</h1><div class="copy"><p>Haidar System is a personal operating brand for building practical digital systems around real problems and opportunities.</p><p>The operating principle is simple: <strong>Real problem → clear system → practical action → measurable proof.</strong></p><p>The work spans business systems, AI, automation, software, integrations, digital interfaces, and emerging technology when those tools are useful.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}.page{padding-top:90px;padding-bottom:120px}.eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:700;color:#73736d}h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.06em;max-width:1000px;margin:0}.copy{max-width:650px;margin:55px 0 0;font-size:1.08rem;color:#5d5d57}.copy p{margin:0 0 25px}
</style>
